OL,3,GNEWSASausage-throwing champ sizzles for
OL,4,Athird year in row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sausage thrower has been crowned
OL,7,Fworld champion for the third year
OL,8,Frunning with a sizzling distance of
OL,9,F148.5ft (45.26m).
OL,11,FPeter Swift, 29, admitted he faced a
OL,12,Fbit of pressure to keep his title ahead
OL,13,Fof taking part in the World Sausage
OL,14,FThrowing Championship in Harwich,
OL,15,FEssex.
OL,17,FAsked about his banger-tossing
OL,18,Ftechnique, his advice was to "try to be
OL,19,Fa little bit more delicate; don't
OL,20,Fcrumple it into a ball as it'll just
OL,21,Fexplode".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
