OL,3,GNEWSASausage-throwing champ sizzles for
OL,4,Athird year in row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis means the competition's record of
OL,7,F171ft (52.12m), thrown by Todd Rothwell
OL,8,Fin 2019, still stands.
